ki/Burning_Icon_Big_a56686.gif\" width=\"16\"/></span></span></div><div class=\"creature-resistance-bar1\"><div class=\"creature-resistance-bar2\" style=\"border-width:1px 1px 1px 1px; width:95.2381%; background-color:#ffffff; left:0.0000%;\"></div><div class=\"creature-resistance-pct\" style=\"position:absolute; right:calc(5px + 4.7619%); display:inline-block;\">100%</div></div></div>\n<div class=\"creature-resistance-el\" data-value=\"1.0500\" title=\"Energy\"><div class=\"creature-resistance-label\">Energy <span typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img alt=\"Electrified Icon Big\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"16\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Electrified_Icon_Big_b60abe.gif\" width=\"16\"/></span></span></div><div class=\"creature-resistance-bar1\"><div class=\"creature-resistance-bar2\" style=\"border-width:1px 1px 1px 1px; width:100.0000%; background-color:#27c429; left:0.0000%;\"></div><div class=\"creature-resistance-pct\" style=\"position:absolute; right:calc(5px + 0.0000%); display:inline-block;\">105%</div></div></div>\n<div class=\"creature-resistance-el\" data-value=\"0.8000\" title=\"Earth\"><div class=\"creature-resistance-label\">Earth <span typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img alt=\"Poisoned Icon Big\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"16\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Poisoned_Icon_Big_f04eb1.gif\" width=\"16\"/></span></span></div><div class=\"creature-resistance-bar1\"><div class=\"creature-resistance-bar2\" style=\"border-width:1px 1px 1px 1px; width:76.1905%; background-color:#d0bd56; left:0.0000%;\"></div><div class=\"creature-resistance-pct\" style=\"position:absolute; right:calc(5px + 23.8095%); display:inline-block;\">80%</div></div></div>\n<div class=\"creature-resistance-el\" data-value=\"1.0000\" title=\"Drown\"><div class=\"creature-resistance-label\">Drown <span typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img alt=\"Drowning Icon Big\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"16\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Drowning_Icon_Big_f65e47.gif\" width=\"16\"/></span></span></div><div class=\"creature-resistance-bar1\"><div class=\"creature-resistance-bar2\" style=\"border-width:1px 1px 1px 1px; width:95.2381%; background-color:#ffffff; left:0.0000%;\"></div><div class=\"creature-resistance-pct\" style=\"position:absolute; right:calc(5px + 4.7619%); display:inline-block;\">100%?</div></div></div>\n<div class=\"creature-resistance-el\" data-value=\"1.0000\" title=\"Healing\"><div class=\"creature-resistance-label\">Healing <span typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img alt=\"Healing Icon\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"16\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Healing_Icon_be4df6.gif\" width=\"16\"/></span></span></div><div class=\"creature-resistance-bar1\"><div class=\"creature-resistance-bar2\" style=\"border-width:1px 1px 1px 1px; width:95.2381%; background-color:#ffffff; left:0.0000%;\"></div><div class=\"creature-resistance-pct\" style=\"position:absolute; right:calc(5px + 4.7619%); display:inline-block;\">100%</div></div></div>\n</div><div style=\"clear:left;\"></div>\n</div>\n<div id=\"w-creature-location\">\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Location\">Location</span></h3>\n<p><a href=\"#/wiki/Northern%20Zao%20Plantations\">Northern Zao Plantations</a>, <a href=\"#/wiki/Souleater%20Mountains\">Souleater Mountains</a>, <a href=\"#/wiki/Muggy%20Plains\">Muggy Plains</a>, <a href=\"#/wiki/Killer%20Caiman%20Cave\">Killer Caiman Cave</a> in the <a href=\"#/wiki/Zao%20Steppe\">Zao Steppe</a> (<a class=\"coord-link\" data-coord=\"33137,31448,7\" title=\"Ver no mapa\">here (33137, 31448, 7)</a>), <a href=\"#/wiki/Chyllfroest\">Chyllfroest</a>.\n</p>\n</div>\n<div id=\"w-creature-behaviour\">\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Behaviour\">Behaviour</span></h3>\n<p>\tThese creatures fight in close combat using melee and are frequently using <a href=\"#/wiki/Haste\">haste</a>.<br/><br/>A killer caiman attacks in melee range. A killer caiman will retreat at 10  (0.67%, deep red) health.\n</p>\n</div>\n<div id=\"w-creature-strategy\">\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Strategy\">Strategy</span></h3>\n<p>\tKiller Caimans are very fast when they use <a href=\"#/wiki/Haste\">Haste</a>, so they can catch up quickly even if they just appeared on the screen. They are very easy to be overlooked due to camouflage and lizards that they are close to. They can drop a lot of money in Gems and <a href=\"#/wiki/Obsidian%20Lance\">Obsidian Lances</a>. You can easily make a fast profit here.\n</p><p><b>Knights</b>: At about <a href=\"#/wiki/Level\">level</a> 80, you can hunt these easily with just <a href=\"#/wiki/Mana%20Potion\">Mana Potions</a> and Recovery and Wound Cleansing with very little cost. Just attack them, and keep mana for <a href=\"#/wiki/Berserk\">Berserk</a> if there are three or more.\n</p><p><b>Paladins</b>: Keep distance at all cost but also be careful not to let yourself get swarmed by other creatures. A good idea is to find a large area of grass/stones and run around it while shooting.\n</p><p><b>Mages</b>: Use Wand of Starstorm/Underworld Rod along with <a href=\"#/wiki/Flame%20Strike\">Flame Strike</a> and/or <a href=\"#/wiki/Energy%20Wave\">Energy Wave</a>/<a href=\"#/wiki/Great%20Energy%20Beam\">Great Energy Beam</a> if you are a sorcerer or <a href=\"#/wiki/Strong%20Ice%20Wave\">Strong Ice Wave</a> if you are a druid. They are only 5% weak for energy, so it's still better to use <a href=\"#/wiki/Great%20Fireball\">Great Fireball</a> instead of Thunderstorm (Thunderstorm does 10% less average damage).\n</p>\n</div>\n<div style=\"clear:both;\"></div>\n<div>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Loot\">Loot</span></h3>\n<p><small><i>Drop rates are estimated based on 42,586 samples <span class=\"loot-stats-link\">(Loot Statistics)</span>.</i></small> <small><i>Colour-coding is applied after 500 samples.</i></small><br/><small><i>Task column indicates items used in delivery tasks.</i></small>\n</p>\n<table class=\"wikitable sortable\" style=\"text-align:center; width:auto;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<th></th>\n<th>Item</th>\n<th>Task</th>\n<th>Quantity</th>\n<th>Avg</th>\n<th data-sort-type=\"number\">%\n</th></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><span class=\"loot-table-icon\"><span class=\"no-pseudoelements-container\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"#/wiki/Gold%20Coin\"><img alt=\"Gold Coin\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"32\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Gold_Coin_a5b511.gif\" width=\"32\"/></a></span></span></span></td>\n<td><a href=\"#/wiki/Gold%20Coin\">Gold Coin</a></td>\n<td></td>\n<td>1-180</td>\n<td>83.1</td>\n<td class=\"loot-common\" data-sort-value=\"99.997652\" style=\"text-align:center;\">100%\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><span class=\"loot-table-icon\"><span class=\"no-pseudoelements-container\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"#/wiki/Ham\"><img alt=\"Ham\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"32\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Ham_25e33a.gif\" width=\"32\"/></a></span></span></span></td>\n<td><a href=\"#/wiki/Ham\">Ham</a></td>\n<td></td>\n<td>1</td>\n<td>0.40</td>\n<td class=\"loot-common\" data-sort-value=\"39.837036\" style=\"text-align:center;\">40%\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><span class=\"loot-table-icon\"><span class=\"no-pseudoelements-container\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"#/wiki/Piece%20of%20Crocodile%20Leather\"><img alt=\"Piece of Crocodile Leather\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"32\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Piece_of_Crocodile_Leather_eed7c6.gif\" width=\"32\"/></a></span></span></span></td>\n<td><a href=\"#/wiki/Piece%20of%20Crocodile%20Leather\">Piece of Crocodile Leather</a></td>\n<td></td>\n<td>1-2</td>\n<td>0.25</td>\n<td class=\"loot-common\" data-sort-value=\"25.015263\" style=\"text-align:center;\">25%\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><span class=\"loot-table-icon\"><span class=\"no-pseudoelements-container\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"#/wiki/Small%20Emerald\"><img alt=\"Small Emerald\" class=\